+config XSWAP
+	bool "Extendable (virtual) swap device"
+	depends on SWAP && 64BIT && ZSWAP && SYSFS
+	help
+	  Adds support for extendable swap devices (xswap) that decouple
+	  PTE swap entries from physical backing storage. The cluster_info
